Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.53,0:01:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus' castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.03,0:01:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Race you there, Joey. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No way you brats won ten star\Nchips each. Oh, boy. Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't some clubhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a place reserved\Nfor the dueling elite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I guess that means\Nwe'll fit right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind telling housekeeping\Nthat I like my pillows extra fluffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Last one, and voila!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, we're finally at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You three don't even have dueling gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have to let us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the cheerleaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you losers think this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A high school football game?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:01:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No star chips. No entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that you're saying you\Ncouldn't do us this one little favor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not Pegasus gave me\Nexplicit instructions not to let anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm and that's that you little\Nthumb suckers open this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner I find Pegasus, the\Nsooner I can find my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandit Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this guy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you know if it isn't Big Tough Joey\Nand his whole crew are dueling dummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You slime bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting to find you ever\Nsince you left us trapped in that cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:03:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss me. Whoops. Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't this little grudge of yours wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish, creedin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, suit yourself, but the\Nreal action is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The real action? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the world champ and Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hoped to get first\Ncrack at the old man myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.57,0:03:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but you know they saved\Nthe biggest match for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.77,0:03:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, are you saying\Nthose two are gonna duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Croquet, Chief Tournament Liaison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on making it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is quite taken with\Nall of your dueling talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, he's so impressed he wanted\Nto reward you with some entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A special exhibition match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll all be quite in\Nawe of what you're about to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This match should give you an idea\Nof what's in store for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So basically, it's meant\Nto intimidate us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Pegasus do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he's a grade-A nutcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Little brother, I'm here for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't let anything\Nstop me from rescuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No hello, no how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were friends, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that my\Nkidnapping Mokuba and seizing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,control of your company\Nhas put a rift between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not like\NI hurt your kid brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you can have\Nhim back if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just beat me in a duel like we\Nagreed and I'll hand him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, one little victory shouldn't be a\Nproblem for the Duel Monsters World Champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That Millennium Eye Pegasus has could make\Nit a real big problem, even for Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm saying this, but\NI'm not hoping Kaiba loses this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I still say he's a first-class jerk\Nfor everything he put us through,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't help but feel for him\Ntrying to get his kid brother back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Far as I'm concerned, anyone who\Nstands up to Pegasus can't be all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey and Tristan are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, what could be more noble\Nthan fighting for someone that you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.25,0:05:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope that Kaiba has learned to\Nfight with his heart, as well as his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so gross to keep us in suspense,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,especially with an audience\Nwaiting in the wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you be in here\Nafter I defeated you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known you'd find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has passed all the tests\Nthat I have presented him with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.15,0:05:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward\Nto this for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll have no\Nproblem dueling with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to duel me with\Nyour latest contraption?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't even know how\Nthe silly device even works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I spin it like a top,\Nor roll it like a ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the theatrics!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, Kaiba means business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then, how about we settle\Nthis like businessmen would?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll agree to use your system if you\Nagree to a request that I have. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing that will change\Nthe game, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.19,0:06:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want someone else to\Noperate your little device for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell a rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, I'll still make\Nall the strategic decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The gameplay won't change at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So why the request?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not fight your own\Nbattle for once in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple-minded fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For all of your titles\Nand technical innovations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,you still haven't learned\Nthat fighting isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way to inflict\Ndamage upon an opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A man's spirit can be\Nbroken in much easier ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Show Kaiba the lad who'll play as my\Npawn and he'll understand my request.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's been hypnotized.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize if he doesn't\Nseem quite like himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but I happen to find that\Nthe captives I keep are far
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,easier to manage after I've\Nmade an extraction of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Petty insults aren't the way to\Nget your brother's soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Pegasus mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have done to Mokuba\Nwhat he did to Yugi's grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you your little brother\Nwas perfectly safe, and he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.53,0:08:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But how long he remains\Nthat way is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat me in a duel and I'll\Nrelease him as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But fail, and not only will his soul\Nremain in bondage, but yours will join it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.03,0:08:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To save your brother, you'll\Nhave to defeat me. Defeat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Pegasus kidnapped Mokuba, but I had\Nno clue that he snatched his soul, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Kaiba went to\Nsuch lengths to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,His brother's even worse\Noff than he thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's like my grandpa now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help Kaiba any way I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use your new invention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But your brother will operate it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.45,0:08:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Kaiba boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Using your own system is sure\Nto give you quite the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't duel my own brother, even\Nif his soul is in another place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You came for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been through enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then, Pegasus, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's his edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll duel on your terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep my little brother out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So rather than duel your empty shell\Nwith the device he's perfected,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll give me home field advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine with me. Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.19,0:09:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in my world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.59,0:09:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out the automated bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire arena's coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That or the biggest elevator ever built.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The two biggest legends in\NDuel Monsters going at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother's fate hangs in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you've got to believe\Nin the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to rescue Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting this duel my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.49,0:10:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't forget that\Nit takes more than a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,strong monster and clever\Nstrategies to win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.19,0:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That Millennium Eye Pegasus\Nhas changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't forget, Kaiba's the\Nguy who took five of his stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.07,0:11:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.98,0:11:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I also know what it's like to be\Ndueling for someone you care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I couldn't live with\Nmyself if I held back on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,anything that could help\NKaiba get his brother back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you're a good duelist,\Nbut I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my battle to fight\Nnow, and I will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor fool. He needs all the\Nhelp that he can get. We've
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,known each other for a long\Ntime and now we'll see if the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,master is the dual monsters\Ncreator or the champion you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,have nowhere left to hide
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,pegasus time to duel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,look
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,at you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The first move and already\Nyou're nervous. Here, defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:12:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,mode feel better oh and i'll\Nplay this card too but i think
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll keep it face down for\Nnow just to keep you guessing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,i doubt that pegasus must\Nalready be scheming something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it's my turn now hmm blue eyes\Non my first draw not bad but
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't risk attacking with\Nhim until i have a better idea
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,of which card pegasus put\Ndown still that doesn't mean i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack with something else.\NI'll lay a card face down too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and also I play Rude Kaiser\Nface up in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Rude Kaiser, attack Pegasus's\Ndefense card with forearm Slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'd expect more\Nfrom you, Pegasus. I had
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,no idea that you had such\Npowerful cards at your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,disposal kyber i don't\Nthink i have a beast in my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,entire deck that could\Ncompare with that creature
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,hold on i may have spoken too soon yes\Nhere's a perfect card parrot dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Bombarding! Not so fast,\NI placed a card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,too remember what and i'm\Nactivating its magic right now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the mesmeric control card\Nentrances your monster and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,reduces its attack power by
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,800 points
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,kaiser
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.67,0:13:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,forearm slash
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no wait, something's\Nwrong here. I don't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it pegasus talks in big\Ngame but duels like a kid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,it's almost like he's\Ntoying with them yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,wait didn't he pull this\Nact with you yep i guess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,he doesn't even take the\Nworld champion seriously
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,i just hope kaiba catches\Non before it's too late
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,something's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,not
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,right this is all too easy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.49,0:14:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,pegasus doesn't even seem\Nto be trying i've taken
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,out two of his monsters\Nwithout him even putting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,up a fight it's almost\Nlike he expected me to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,do it like he knew\Nexactly how i was going to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,attack him my turn pegasus
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,another good card but
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.43,0:14:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,if i'm right about pegasus and he is just
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.55,0:14:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,playing with me he might\Nbe able to counter it i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.61,0:14:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,not falling for this bit\Nno way i'll just play
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,something that i I know\Nhe can't defend against!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.87,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to play a\Nlittle guessing game with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,that card you're about to\Nthrow out on the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A game?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of a duel here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm allowed to play a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap card said so! Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I played a card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Prophecy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and it gives me the right to\Nguess whether the card you're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,about to play has an attack\Npower higher or lower than 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I manage to guess correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Boy, then the card in\Nquestion becomes mine. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.65,0:15:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I'll prophesize\Nthat it is indeed over 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Something else is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.27,0:15:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I see white. Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I right? Tell me I\Nwas right. I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,right i so hope i was\Nright enough here take it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,now the most valuable card in your\Ndeck is mine that's impossible there's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.95,0:16:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,no way he could have seen my blue\Neyes before i played it how did he
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,know pegasus must be up to his old\Ntricks you got that right he must be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,using his millennium eye to look at\Nkaiba's cards Just like he did with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even his great skills don't stand\Na chance against Pegasus' powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have two things\Nyou care about, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dragon and your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what else I can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.69,0:16:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,After your turn, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Without my blue-eyes-white dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to switch\Nmy monster to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodie, now it's my turn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.59,0:16:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Kaiba looks so anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should look into the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.09,0:16:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's look at what\Ncards he's holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a virus card, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And Soggy the Dark Clown. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:17:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're planning to contaminate my deck\Nby using those two in a combo attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And normally a move like that would clinch\Nthe match for you, but not today, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,because as soon as you try\Nand make that move on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have a little something\Nof my own waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lay one card face down on the field\Nand one monster face down in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid that's the best\Nmove that I could come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn and my chance to\Nfinish this duel in one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.23,0:17:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Combo attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Infecting Sadi with this\Ncrush card and then having
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,him attack will spread a\Nvirus through Pegasus' deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster he has\Nwith over 1,500 attack
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,points will be disease-ridden and useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I remember this move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the same thing Kaiba\Nused on Yugi in their duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, Pegasus\Nis gonna catch the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't count on it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus knows that it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you just played your crush card,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:18:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think now would be an\Nopportune time to activate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.95,0:18:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.59,0:18:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It doubles your clown's attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And since the Crush card can only be hosted\Nby monsters with less than a thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Points. My magic makes Saggy the Dark\NClown too strong for the job. So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He had the perfect defense all set\Nup before I even attacked But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what's wrong, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.59,0:18:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You look so sad Keep your chin up I'm\Nsure it was just a lucky move on my part
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what they say, Kaiba.\NIt's better to be lucky than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, talk about luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my dark energy\Nspell, he's twice as strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure he's still no\Nmatch for your stalwart clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And I always thought a rabbit\Npunch was a wimpy move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:19:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Kaiba so shaken before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel just started, and Kaiba's\Nalready a thousand life points behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you see how feeble your skills\Ntruly are, Kaiba boy, world champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I make you look like a novice,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've only just begun to\Nmake use of my millennium eye.
